{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2\u20134 player co-op party game</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaotic, fast-paced teamwork</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic challenges and short, replayable sessions</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Travel across space-time to repair machines in bizarre locations</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vibrant pixel art inspired by classic cartoons and slapstick animation</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966420/extras/227971c841e2240dd0d151b285d0ed83.avif?t=1774453740\" alt=\"splashart\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A chaotic co-op party game for two to four players. </strong><br>You and your friends are interplanetary repair technicians sent across different dimensions to fix malfunctioning machines and keep everything running.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Working together is the only way to survive the job\u2026 but coordination might be harder than the repairs themselves.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Travel Across Dimensions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mission will take your crew to a new destination filled with broken machinery waiting to be fixed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966420/extras/26cf9df51986999eb7af583067c96f51.poster.avif?t=1774453740\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966420/extras/26cf9df51986999eb7af583067c96f51.webm?t=1774453740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966420/extras/26cf9df51986999eb7af583067c96f51.mp4?t=1774453740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game blends <strong>action, coordination, and tool-based minigames</strong> in frantic <strong>short sessions</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gear up for the job:</strong> grab your tools<strong> or catch one thrown by a teammate </strong>and get ready to work with your team.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keep moving:\u00a0 Move quickly through the level, dodge obstacles, and reach broken machines before it's too late.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fix the problem: Use the correct tool to activate minigames and bring damaged machines back online.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966420/extras/1d7c9972b786518a97e343d6491d59d0.poster.avif?t=1774453740\" width=638 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966420/extras/1d7c9972b786518a97e343d6491d59d0.webm?t=1774453740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966420/extras/1d7c9972b786518a97e343d6491d59d0.mp4?t=1774453740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mistakes matter:</strong> failing a minigame wastes precious time and slows your team down.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stay coordinated:</strong> machines keep breaking, and the only way to keep up is to work together.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966420/extras/c84bae431c7150df1b166e59e4743b3d.poster.avif?t=1774453740\" width=638 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966420/extras/c84bae431c7150df1b166e59e4743b3d.webm?t=1774453740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966420/extras/c84bae431c7150df1b166e59e4743b3d.mp4?t=1774453740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pass the tools: Toss tools across the map to speed things up and keep everyone working efficiently.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966420/extras/335dcbf8027794563990bb4532b5857d.poster.avif?t=1774453740\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966420/extras/335dcbf8027794563990bb4532b5857d.webm?t=1774453740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966420/extras/335dcbf8027794563990bb4532b5857d.mp4?t=1774453740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Online Cooperation</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teamwork is at the heart of the experience.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use emotes</strong> to communicate quickly with your teammates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our discord server here: LINK</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kick and throw tools to each other</strong> to speed up repairs and keep the workflow going.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966420/extras/bdd960b324824a67e574f9174f45cd2b.poster.avif?t=1774453740\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966420/extras/bdd960b324824a67e574f9174f45cd2b.webm?t=1774453740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966420/extras/bdd960b324824a67e574f9174f45cd2b.mp4?t=1774453740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or just kick your teammates asses\u2026 everything can happen.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Different Worlds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While we're still building the full range of destinations, here\u2019s a sneak peek at our <strong>sprites</strong> for the worlds to come. Each location is crafted to bring new challenges, surprises, and a fresh visual experience to your cooperative adventures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966420/extras/dc67b7f00018fe2f3bc31aa09c2c8805.avif?t=1774453740\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966420/extras_big/dc67b7f00018fe2f3bc31aa09c2c8805.webp?t=1774453740 width=1560 height=423 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Next stop: another repair job.</strong> Are you and your crew ready?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/s